  /Type /StructElem
  /S /H2
  /P 252 0 R
  /T (With this app, you will learn how to upload images with an HTML form and PHP, how to verify user passwords securely and how to check if the user is logged in with PHP session. You'll also learn to use a relational database to store the information of your app and how to connect to it from PHP with PDO.)
  /K [15 254 0 R]
  /Pg 642 0 R
>>
