259 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /H2
  /P 258 0 R
  /T (You have now acquired the basics of the PHP language. To practice them, you will now create a blog web application with a simple login system and a list of blog posts. Unlike previous TypeScript and React todo list apps, which were "frontend only" apps (all the code ran in the browser, you just used a REST API to fetch data). This time, you will create a "back-end only" app, where all the code runs on the server with PHP and only static HTML and CSS are sent to the browser. No JavaScript is used in this app.)
  /K [4 260 0 R]
  /Pg 642 0 R
>>
endobj

